            </button>
        </div>

        <div id="resultCard" class="mt-6 hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-900 to-purple-900 text-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-indigo-200 border-b border-indigo-700/50 pb-3 mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>نتیجه محاسبات هوشمند</span>
                <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">محاسبه استراحت‌ها اعمال شد</span>
            </h2>
            
            <div class="space-y-3.5">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-xl">
                    <span class="text-sm text-indigo-200">ساعت دقیق اتمام کار:</span>
                    <span id="finishTimeText" class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-300">--:--</span>
